{"pages":[{"segs":[["THE HERO WINS",58.650400000000005,360.10399999999993,344.40139999999997,416.08499999999992,37,false],["THE HERO WINS",58.650400000000005,360.10399999999993,344.40139999999997,416.08499999999992,37,false],["IN THE END",58.650400000000005,390.11099999999988,262.15039999999999,446.09199999999987,37,false],["IN THE END",58.650400000000005,390.11099999999988,262.15039999999999,446.09199999999987,37,false],["BUT HE",78.5,415.74199999999996,296.04879999999997,518.33399999999995,64,false],["BUT HE",78.5,416.34199999999998,296.04879999999997,518.93399999999997,64,false],["DIES IN THE",78.5,465.726,422.29519999999991,568.31799999999998,64,false],["DIES IN THE",78.5,466.32600000000002,422.29519999999991,568.91800000000001,64,false],["MIDDLE",122.27600000000001,515.70999999999992,348.06799999999998,618.30199999999991,64,false],["MIDDLE",122.27600000000001,516.30999999999995,348.06799999999998,618.90200000000004,64,false],["THE STORY",483.71000000000004,251.93429999999989,665.46500000000015,304.88929999999993,35,false],["We experience life as a story, because life is",462.50640000000004,300.40189999999996,659.06325000000004,314.81139999999994,11.5,false],["a story and that story goes something like",462.50640000000004,311.90189999999996,652.40590000000009,326.31139999999994,11.5,false],["this . . .",462.50640000000004,323.40189999999996,493.26890000000003,337.81139999999994,11.5,false],["BETRAYAL- We were created for a rela-",462.50640000000004,346.16039999999987,649.97824999999989,361.11039999999991,11.5,false],["tionship with God. But our hearts turned",462.50640000000004,357.90189999999996,647.34590000000003,372.31139999999994,11.5,false],["proud, and pride corrupted. We abandoned",462.50640000000004,369.40189999999996,660.42139999999995,383.81139999999994,11.5,false],["God and intimacy turned to alienation.",462.50640000000004,380.90189999999996,636.97175000000004,395.31139999999994,11.5,false],["Humanity is now fallen. None of us lives or",462.50640000000004,392.40189999999996,657.37390000000005,406.81139999999994,11.5,false],["loves as we ought.",462.50640000000004,403.90189999999996,544.94990000000007,418.31139999999994,11.5,false],["ANTICIPATION- Though we betrayed",462.50640000000004,426.66039999999987,641.85924999999997,441.61039999999991,11.5,false],["God, He did not abandon us. Through the",462.50640000000004,438.40189999999996,651.26740000000007,452.81139999999994,11.5,false],["prophets God promised to send a Sav-",462.50640000000004,449.90189999999996,637.28340000000003,464.31139999999994,11.5,false],["ior (the Messiah) who would restore and",462.50640000000004,461.40189999999996,647.34475000000009,475.81139999999994,11.5,false],["rescue us from the consequences of our sin",462.50640000000004,472.90189999999996,661.74390000000005,487.31139999999994,11.5,false],["and betrayal.",462.50640000000004,484.40189999999996,520.48940000000005,498.81139999999994,11.5,false],["PURSUIT-",462.50640000000004,507.16039999999987,512.53140000000008,522.11039999999991,11.5,false],["As promised, God sent the one",517.7754000000001,507.16039999999987,658.1559000000002,522.11039999999991,11.5,false],["who would rescue and restore us. His name",462.50640000000004,518.90189999999996,660.10975000000008,533.31139999999994,11.5,false],["was Jesus. The unique Son of God became",462.50640000000004,530.40189999999996,655.78690000000006,544.81139999999994,11.5,false],["one of us. He spoke truth, modeled love,",462.50640000000004,541.90189999999996,646.02340000000004,556.31139999999994,11.5,false],["granted forgiveness, and offered life in all of",462.50640000000004,553.40189999999996,661.6404,567.81139999999994,11.5,false],["its fullness.",462.50640000000004,564.90189999999996,512.04840000000002,579.31139999999994,11.5,false],["SACRIFICE- Life’s greatest mystery was",462.50640000000004,587.66039999999998,647.95425,602.61039999999991,11.5,false],["revealed in love’s greatest act. Jesus, the",462.50640000000004,599.40189999999996,645.16090000000008,613.81139999999994,11.5,false],["author of life, died for us: taking upon him-",462.50640000000004,610.90189999999996,656.59190000000001,625.31139999999994,11.5,false],["self our guilt and atoning for our sin. How",462.50640000000004,622.40189999999996,651.53190000000018,636.81139999999994,11.5,false],["can we be sure? God raised Jesus from the",462.50640000000004,633.90189999999996,656.15375000000006,648.31139999999994,11.5,false],["dead. He is alive today and offers life to all",462.50640000000004,645.40189999999996,652.97974999999997,659.81139999999994,11.5,false],["who would receive it.",462.50640000000004,656.90189999999996,558.51990000000001,671.31139999999994,11.5,false],["THE GIFT- Now God invites us to come",462.50640000000004,679.66039999999998,648.16240000000005,694.61039999999991,11.5,false],["back to him through trusting in Jesus.",462.50640000000004,691.40189999999996,633.68389999999999,705.81139999999994,11.5,false],["Forgiveness is a free and undeserved gift,",462.50640000000004,702.90189999999996,649.10540000000003,717.31139999999994,11.5,false],["received only through genuine faith in Jesus",462.50640000000004,714.40189999999996,662.06590000000006,728.81139999999994,11.5,false],["Christ.",462.50640000000004,725.90189999999996,491.93490000000003,740.31139999999994,11.5,false],["My Father’s will is that everyone who looks",462.50640000000004,749.00540000000001,655.84439999999995,763.25389999999993,11.5,false],["to the son and believes in him shall have",462.50640000000004,760.50540000000001,643.94074999999998,774.75389999999993,11.5,false],["eternal life, and I will raise him up at the last",462.50640000000004,772.00540000000001,660.10975000000008,786.25389999999993,11.5,false],["day (John 6:40).",462.50640000000004,783.40189999999996,536.65840000000003,797.81139999999994,11.5,false],["This is the story—our story—from rebellion",462.50640000000004,806.40189999999996,662.49025000000006,820.81139999999994,11.5,false],["to reunion: our journey back to intimacy",462.50640000000004,817.90189999999996,645.40125,832.31139999999994,11.5,false],["with God.",462.50640000000004,829.40189999999996,506.09140000000002,843.81139999999994,11.5,false],["A TURNING POINT? All good stories have",462.50640000000004,852.16039999999998,659.92689999999993,867.11039999999991,11.5,false],["turning points and this could be the turn-",462.50640000000004,863.90189999999996,650.04724999999996,878.31139999999994,11.5,false],["ing point of your story. If you desire to turn",462.50640000000004,875.40189999999996,658.82175000000007,889.81139999999994,11.5,false],["to God and receive Christ, you can express",462.50640000000004,886.90189999999996,655.60059999999999,901.31139999999994,11.5,false],["that right now to God, silently, in prayer.",462.50640000000004,898.40189999999996,643.56240000000003,912.81139999999994,11.5,false],["If you’d like to find out more, just go to Ev-",462.50640000000004,921.40189999999996,655.30390000000011,935.81139999999994,11.5,false],["eryStudent.com where millions of students",462.50640000000004,932.90189999999996,657.91440000000011,947.31139999999994,11.5,false],["have gone to explore faith.",462.50640000000004,944.40189999999996,582.94590000000005,958.81139999999994,11.5,false],["EVERYSTUDENT.COM",391.72030000000001,989.32799999999997,667.96250000000009,1031.0060000000001,26,false]],"w":720,"h":1080,"ocr":false}]}